  "content": "<p>如需此模組的資料包版本，請前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-regions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><p>為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">未探索區域</a>新增更多<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事</a>砧板配方</p><ul>\n<li>所有（適用）木材類型的樹皮、剝皮與回收功能</li>\n<li>從可產染料的植物中獲取更多染料</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/regions_unexplored/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"木材切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/regions_unexplored/media/floracutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"花卉切割\"></p><p>想要一次性獲得所有農夫切割內容？請查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫切割合集</a>！</p>",
